    This document authorizes the above vessel and its captain to assist and cooperate with the TSFMC and Frontier authorities in neutralizing hostile bluespace threats to Frontier. These include, but are not limited to:
        { "[" }bullet] Cultist vessels
        { "[" }bullet] Syndicate vessels
        { "[" }bullet] Wizard Federation vessels
        { "[" }bullet] Arcadia Industries vessels
     
    This document does NOT deputize the authorized party. The authorized party is not granted special privileges to arrest, detain, and prosecute individuals associated with Nanotrasen.
     
    { "[" }bold]Any contraband seized during operations aboard hostile vessels must be surrendered, either to the TSFMC or Colossus Central's overseer, for a cash bounty. Failure to surrender contraband will lead to the forfeiture of this agreement, and the authorized party may be liable for criminal charges.[/bold]
     
    The authorized party is to keep a copy of this document for inspection. The authorized party is expected to maintain contact with TSFMC command and/or Colossus Central's overseer to minimize casualties.
     
    Before engaging with hostile vessels, the authorized party is expected to follow any instructions given by the TSFMC for staging or other preparation prior to boarding.
     
     
     
    { "[" }color=#AAAAAA]This Form is void without the signatures of both Parties and a stamp of Frontier Command (Colonel or Colossus Central's overseer).[/color]

